@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:User enters editappt ID NUMBER with options
[~--date NEW] [~--details DETAILS] [~--add-details DETAILS];

if () then ([arguments are invalid, or
no option is given])
    :Report the invalid format, number or value,
    the repeated or conflicting options,
    or that an option is needed;
    stop
endif
if () then ([no patient has ID, or
patient has no NUMBER])
    :Report the missing patient
    or appointment number;
    stop
endif
:Replace the appointment with the edited one, keeping
its completion status and the values not given;
if () then ([the date or time changes])
    :Place it after the others at its new date and
    time, which can renumber the patient's appointments;
else ([else])
    :Keep its number;
endif
if () then ([two undone visits clash])
    :Append a warning naming the other
    patients and appointment numbers;
endif
:Save the data file, show the Appointments
view and select the edited appointment;
stop
@enduml
